{7}{This is Caladon's highest security dungeon.  Here reside Caladon's most notorious criminals.  Now begone, lest we make you one of our "guests!"}{This is Caladon's highest security dungeon.  Here reside Caladon's most notorious criminals.  Now begone, lest we make you one of our "guests!"}{}{}{}{re -5}
{8}{I heard a rumor that you hold JT Morgan here.}{}{5}{tr14 1}{11}{}
{9}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{10}{E:}{}{-4}{}{0}{}
{11}{Yes, the notorious Mr. Morgan does indeed abide behind these doors.}{Yes, the notorious Mr. Morgan does indeed abide behind these doors.}{}{}{}{}
{12}{I'll bet he keeps you busy, what with his locksmith skills and all...}{}{5}{}{15}{}
{13}{Can I get in to take a look?  I've never seen a real criminal before.}{}{5}{}{23}{}
{14}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{15}{Not really.  Ever since he took it upon himself to break into the royal palace, we have added extensive safeguards to insure his extended stay.  Also, he can not possibly be as good as it rumored.  He was caught, was he not?}{Not really.  Ever since he took it upon himself to break into the royal palace, we have added extensive safeguards to insure his extended stay.  Also, he can not possibly be as good as it rumored.  He was caught, was he not?}{}{}{}{}
{16}{So you're not worried about him escaping?}{}{5}{}{19}{}
{17}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{18}{Enemy of Caladon!  Enemy of Caladon!  Death to the traitor!}{Enemy of Caladon!  Enemy of Caladon!  Death to the traitor!}{}{}{}{re-15}
{19}{Not at all.  As I have stated, this is Caladon's highest security dungeon.  It is under constant guard.  Also, his cell has the strongest, most intricate locking system I have ever beheld.  The royal inventor constructed it specially for use on Mr. Morgan.}{Not at all.  As I have stated, this is Caladon's highest security dungeon.  It is under constant guard.  Also, his cell has the strongest, most intricate locking system I have ever beheld.  The royal inventor constructed it specially for use on Mr. Morgan.}{}{}{}{}
{20}{Who is this Royal Inventor? I'd like to meet him?}{}{5}{}{39}{}
{21}{How would one go about getting in to see him?}{}{5}{}{23}{re -5}
{22}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{23}{Mr. Morgan is allowed no visitors, by order of the King.}{Mr. Morgan is allowed no visitors, by order of the King.}{}{}{}{}
{24}{No visitors whatsoever?  I think that would drive a man mad.}{}{5}{}{26}{re -5}
{25}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{26}{He is allowed one visitor.  His mother, Mrs. Morgan, is allowed to see her son to insure his wellbeing at regular intervals.}{He is allowed one visitor.  His mother, Mrs. Morgan, is allowed to see her son to insure his wellbeing at regular intervals.}{}{}{}{}
{27}{Ah.  So she lives nearby?}{}{5}{}{29}{}
{28}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{29}{Not far.  Her residence is located in Roseborough.}{Not far.  Her residence is located in Roseborough.}{}{}{}{gf2225 1}
{30}{Well.  I guess I shall go speak to her...}{}{5}{}{37}{re -10}
{31}{A most interesting tale.  Thank you for your time.  Goodbye.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{32}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{33}{What business would you have with her?  Dare you sympathize with an enemy of Caladon!?!}{What business would you have with her?  Dare you sympathize with an enemy of Caladon!?!}{}{}{}{}
{34}{Uh... No!  No!  It's not that at all.  I must be leaving.  Goodbye.}{}{5}{}{37}{}
{35}{What business of it is yours, to whom I speak?}{}{5}{}{}{co, fl 18}
